desktop_lvgl: For testing
desktop_raspberry: Factory desktop
The default option provides desktop_lvgl

When you need desktop_raspberry, simply copy the firstrun.sh file in the desktop_raspberry folder and update it to the firstrun.sh file in the cm0_resource_collect folder.
When you need desktop_lvgl, copy the firstrun.sh file in the desktop_lvgl folder and update it to the firstrun.sh file in the cm0_resource_collect folder.
